  "已选择 {count} 份摘录。": "{count} excerpts selected. ",
  "材料没有读取完成：{error}。可以继续复制不含摘录的说明。": "Could not finish reading material: {error}. You can still copy the instructions without excerpts.",
  "无法读取已保存的语言，当前选择仍可在本次使用中生效。": "Could not read the saved language. Your current selection still works for this session.",
